The proposed pecuniary penalties are:
in respect of the first respondent, $280,000 payable by bi-annual instalments over six years;
in respect of the second respondent, $60,000 also payable by bi-annual instalments over six years;
in respect of the third respondent, $65,000 payable by monthly instalments over 18 months; and
in respect of the fourth respondent, $15,000 also payable by monthly instalments over 18 months.
In each case, any default in the payment of instalments, which is not remedied within 30 days, will result in the full amount of the penalty, then outstanding, to become immediately due and payable.
